{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"　\nこんばちは\nクッションカバーって定期的に変えたくなっちゃっていつのまにかたっくさん溜まってきますよね？私だけに起こる現象👾？\n佐々木久美です🦒くみてんです🦒"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3WFT8DR53BSZB5JANBB2S2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nじゃーん先日、櫻坂46キャプテンゆっかー先輩とグループを代表して初詣に行ってきました！\n今年もみーんなが健康で楽しい一年が過ごせますように🐯💎そうお願いしてきました。おみくじも引きました〜\nゆっかーミュージカル頑張ってね！！応援している！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お知らせです💠本日、1月14日（金）24:30〜から3週連続で放送される日本テレビ「解禁コネコネクラブ」に出演させていただきます！\nコネがないと手に入らない激レア情報ばかりなので是非ご覧ください🦦"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お正月に千葉の海に行きました〜🐶千葉のこともっと知りたくなった！！！千葉出身なので🥜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3WFVCFYE9NMPVSNCXYDKPS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3WFWDWMFNY7CBN17S4WGK6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3WFXFFY0MF5A51BDRMNQ80","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3WFYFFE512FFWG7WK1PM8P","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n友達がいっぱい撮ってくれた🐋"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3WFZHYHGS8THP92A9X0VBE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3WG0K27C43YVZH4SMB3S39","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3WG1K6155HEW4HDKVEZZ1D","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n夕陽も綺麗でした〜🌇"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3WG2KVTKMH4EXPQ7GQK2KW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nゴンフリークスになりかけている、、、👊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではまたね( ˙-˙ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"}